# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Order (0.4.3 fix round): after Mount Hyjal (level model about 58 at its end), one visit to Silithus: Layo
# Starstrike at Valor's Rest, Cenarion Hold's two rounds, the Twilight dig, Hive'Zora, Southwind Village, Hermit
# Ortell and the Twilight Keepers. Felwood, Winterspring, Moonglade, Darnassus, Stormwind and the Plaguelands, which
# this guide used to tour at 58-60, are done on their first visits at 54-58 now (the Felwood, Winterspring and Western
# Plaguelands guides), and Silithus is one visit instead of two.
# Left out: Deathclasp (8283: an elite scorpid).

