# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north-west

step Hive'Ashi: kill these as you meet them
  zone Silithus
  tip The Twilight's Hammer dig fills the north-west corner: tablet fragments lie on the ground and the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers carry them too. Every cultist can drop an Encrypted Twilight Text: keep twenty, ten for Bor Wildmane and ten for Hermit Ortell later.
  tip Careful: take the texts from the Twilight Avengers and Geolords; leave the Twilight Flamereavers (60) and stay out of the hive's mouth, where the Hive'Ashi elites (59-60) wait.
  tip The Hive'Ashi silithids sometimes drop Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter: keep it for Bronzebeard's Encampment in the south.
  collect 20404 quest 8318.1          -- Twilight's Hammer cultists
  collect 20378 quest 8284.1 @22.0,14.5 -- Twilight Tablet Fragments
  collect 20404 x20 optional          -- Ten more for True Believers

step Hive'Zora
  tip Marshal Bluewall camps outside Hive'Zora, the western hive. Pick up a Silithyst at one of the red geysers nearby and carry it to the Alliance extractor at his camp.
  tip Careful: You lose the Silithyst if you mount, stealth, use Divine Shield, Feign Death or Vanish. Blink and Power Word: Shield do not drop it.
  turnin 9415                         -- Marshal Bluewall
  accept 9419
  kill 17090 quest 9419.1 @32.95,50.81 "Bring a Silithyst to the Alliance extractor"
  turnin 9419

step Cenarion Hold
  turnin 8318                         -- Bor Wildmane
  turnin 8284                         -- Geologist Larksbane
  accept 8285

