  tip Ride south-west to the dwarves' camp near the southern mountains and question Frankal Stonebridge and Rutgar Glyphshaper. Noggle's satchel lies in the sand south-east of the camp, where Deathclasp, an elite scorpid, patrols: grab it while he is away.
