step Level 60
  zone Silithus
  when level<60
  tip Cenarion Hold's last hand-ins can leave a player who followed only this route short of 60 (up to about a level for the slowest; most players less).
  tip With a group: run the Scholomance dungeon or the Stratholme dungeon, in the Plaguelands by Chillwind Camp and Light's Hope Chapel.
  tip Alone: the Twilight's Hammer camps of Silithus's north-west (Twilight Avengers 57-59 and Geolords 58-60; leave the Flamereavers, 60) and the Stonelash Flayers and Rock Stalkers (57-59) around Cenarion Hold are at your level. Cenarion Hold's repeatable quests open only at 60.
  level 60
